    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "cleaning dust etc. from rooms",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "週末は家族総出で、家の隅々のすす払いをする予定だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "引っ越しを機に、家具の裏側まで徹底的にすす払いをした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "エアコンのフィルターに溜まった埃を、すす払いして綺麗にする。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "「おりおりは、目ものう、すす払いをするものじゃ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "右門捕物帖",
                "author": "死人ぶろ",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "それゆえ、ときおりは目のすす払いしたらどうかと申すのじゃ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "右門捕物帖",
                "author": "死人ぶろ",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "(the traditional Japanese end-of-the-year, 13th December) big house cleaning",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "京都の西本願寺では、毎年恒例のすす払いがニュースで報じられる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "すす払いが終わると、いよいよお正月が近づいてきた実感が湧く。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "畳を叩いてすす払いをする音があちこちから聞こえてくる、師走の風景。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
